 925               /BIT INVERSION ROUTINE
 926               /ENTRY: AC=WORD TO BE INVERTED; EXIT:AC=RESULT
 927               /NU CONTAINS THE NUMBER OF BITS IN THE WORD
 928 011036  0000  INVRT,  0
 929 011037  3256          DCA WORD                /GET WORD TO BE INVERTED
 930 011040  3257          DCA WORDP       /ZERO OBJECT REGISTER
 931 011041  1004          TAD NU          /GET NUMBER OF BITS TO BE
 932 011042  7041          CIA             /INVERTED AND USE TO LIMIT THE
 933 011043  3260          DCA FLIPCT      /EXTENT OF LOOP
 934 011044  1256  FLIP,   TAD WORD                /PULL OUT RIGHTMOST BIT OF WORD
 935 011045  7110          CLL RAR                 /(RIGHT MOST BIT NOW IN LINK)
 936 011046  3256          DCA WORD                /(PUT BACK SO A NEW BIT IS OPERATED ON EACH TIME)
 937 011047  1257          TAD WORDP       /AND PUSH INTO WORDP FROM LEFT
 938 011050  7004          RAL
 939 011051  3257          DCA WORDP
 940 011052  2260          ISZ FLIPCT      /ALL BITS DONE?
 941 011053  5244          JMP FLIP                /NO. DO NEXT BIT
 942 011054  1257          TAD WORDP       /YES. PICK UP RESULT
 943 011055  5636          JMP I INVRT     /AND EXIT
 944 011056  0000  WORD,   0
 945 011057  0000  WORDP,  0
 946 011060  0000  FLIPCT, 0
