1003               /AND THEN CHECKED TO SEE IF IT CAN BE NORMALIZED AFTER ADDITION
1004               /ENTRY: AC=ADDEND,C(ADD2)=AUGEND
1005               /EXIT : AC=RESULT, DIVIDED BY TWO IF NECESSARY.
